    "blurb": "Zombie survival in the first winter after the dead rose: scavenging, shelter, and the horde at the edge of hearing.",
    "description": "A Powered by the Apocalypse survival game for a modern world in its first winter after the dead rose. Characters scavenge the ruins, hold a shelter, barter for medicine and fuel, nurse wounds and infection, and listen for the horde. Fights are a conversation of moves, not turns: there is no initiative, no rounds, and no attack roll for a threat. The cause of the fall is unwritten. The GM invents the region, the shelter, the survivors, and the trouble from the setting tables.",
